# K4b mutation proofs — the ELF64 loader harness (check stage 13)

Date: 2026-09-29. Baseline: commit 76a3410 (kernel/src/elf.rs, elfselftest.rs,
fixtures, tools/verify-elf64.py, kernel/scripts/test-elf64.sh all committed
BEFORE any mutation; reverts via git checkout -- against that commit).

Every transcript block below was extracted programmatically from the capture
files listed, not retyped. Console output during this session was partially
garbled (tool-transport corruption, documented in the task report); the
load-bearing lines were re-read from the files on disk afterward.

